+# SU2 abelian manifolds and instanton L spaces
+
+The original KP-3.51 question remains **unsolved**. [OBSTRUCTION.md](OBSTRUCTION.md) identifies the gap between an abelian representation set and control of degenerate instanton critical points. An abstract local-homology diagnostic is not asserted to arise from a three-manifold.
+
+A separate part checks the exact printed Definition 5.3 and torus-knot clause of Corollary 5.4 in arXiv:2608.20551v1 using trefoil surgery at slope 6. This is a narrow, version-specific mathematical check. The resulting manifold is a known instanton L-space and does not refute the original question. No broader conclusion about the source or its authors is asserted.
+
+The frozen package passed [separate review](review/REVIEW.md); all 114 submitted and 100 independent checks passed. One substantive attempt was used. Run python3 verify.py for the submitted exact diagnostics. No novelty or priority is claimed.
